1
00:00:07,352 --> 00:00:08,952
(Stuart:)I don't want to rush you,

2
00:00:08,955 --> 00:00:10,885
(Stuart:)but I'm closing
a little early tonight.

3
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:13,060
(Raj:)Ooh. Hot date?

4
00:00:13,059 --> 00:00:15,489
(Stuart:)Uh, no. I overheard
Bernadette tell Howard

5
00:00:15,495 --> 00:00:17,065
(Stuart:)she was making him a meat loaf,

6
00:00:17,063 --> 00:00:19,463
(Stuart:)and you don't have
to not ask me twice.

7
00:00:21,066 --> 00:00:24,336
If I stick a lightbulb on this,
wouldn't it make a great lamp

8
00:00:24,337 --> 00:00:26,737
(Emily:)for my bedroom?

9
00:00:26,739 --> 00:00:29,509
(Raj:)You're kidding, right?

10
00:00:29,509 --> 00:00:31,539
(Emily:)Oh. Is this freaking you out?

11
00:00:31,544 --> 00:00:34,474
(Raj:)I guess I'm just more
of a Pottery Barn,

12
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:36,380
(Raj:)Crate and Barrel kind of guy.

13
00:00:37,749 --> 00:00:40,349
(Raj:)Maybe Pier 1
if I really want to cut loose.

14
00:00:40,353 --> 00:00:43,053
(Emily:)All right. Never mind.

15
00:00:43,055 --> 00:00:45,025
(Raj:)No, no, no.
Hey, you should totally get it.

16
00:00:45,024 --> 00:00:46,524
(Raj:)In fact, I'll buy it for you.

17
00:00:46,526 --> 00:00:47,826
Sold!

18
00:00:49,861 --> 00:00:51,901
(Emily:)Raj, you don't have to do that.

19
00:00:51,898 --> 00:00:53,668
Too late!
No returns!

20
00:00:56,067 --> 00:00:58,937
(Leonard:)That was really intense.

21
00:00:58,938 --> 00:01:01,738
(Penny:)Well, now we know, next time
we go to the farmers' market,

